  "body": "Rare Coastal Land with Stunning Sea views  in Top Westlake zone - Build Your Dream by the Shore \r\n\r\nPositioned directly opposite the coastline in one of the North Shore's most tightly held Campbells bay , this exceptional 2,459m² freehold site presents a once-in-a-generation opportunity to secure prime land with uninterrupted panoramic ocean views.\r\n\r\nThis property offers outstanding potential for subdivision (subject to the usual consents), luxury redevelopment, or the creation of a landmark architectural residence designed to maximize the breathtaking sea outlook.\r\n\r\nWhether you are a developer, land banker, or visionary homeowner, this blue-chip parcel delivers scale, location, and future upside rarely found in such a premium coastal position.\r\n\r\nKey Points\r\n*\t2,459m² freehold landholding\r\n*\tDirectly facing the beach with expansive sea views\r\n*\tExceptional subdivision and development potential \r\n*\tTop school zone , Murrays Bay Intermediate, Westlake Boy and Girls School\r\n*\tClose to beaches, cafés, and amenities\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are exceptionally rare - secure your position on one of Auckland's most desirable coastal strips. \r\n\r\nView by Appointment \r\nPlease call or text us anytime if any interest",
